me it's hella soft and delicious. I think their wings batter is mixed with Tony's. I'm kind of basic, so I think it tastes pretty good. Overall, my meal was $4.99. Where can you find better deal for some good soul food?"},{"business_id":"r-776l-hZC4Vngbgn8KLQA","review_id":"jo443PWAdUGwXRYMXYGcNw","date":"2020-02-17T17:03:24","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9072003960609436,"text_excerpt":"The best place to get a quick breakfast plate or some home cooked food when you're on the go. Don't expect it to be the cleanest or one of the nicest places, but their breakfast and fried chicken wings are to die for. Try it out if u looking for a hot plate of food for under $5!"},{"business_id":"r-776l-hZC4Vngbgn8KLQA","review_id":"MmsLHaShv_KodC8p9sXpGg","date":"2020-02-17T21:40:38","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.905373215675354,"text_excerpt":"Absolutely love this place, I haven't had a bad thing on the menu yet. Even the raw meat is fresh ready for the pot. The staff is friendly even the owner mike greets you with a smile!!! If I can eat here everyday I will definitely do just that. Oh and let's not forget about the prices... it's affordable for the amount of food you're getting"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
